  "title": "Cranberry Orange Quick Bread",
  "description": "Rich and hearty cranberry-orange bread made with sour cream. Appropriate for breakfast, brunch or just a snack. My in-laws gobbled it up for Thanksgiving!",
  "authors": [
    "ZETA426"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:10:28-04:00",
